{"name":"-17-7-2First","beats":[{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sneak","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm back, and things don't look good at all... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I mean, that's still the Military's main force out there..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get to the point. What are the Military's current movements?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well... the Military's vanguard units are sweeping the contaminated areas, while the armored units are standing by at the perimeter. They'll probably catch up soon. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, even if their vanguards are just recon units, we're still no match for them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If we keep targeting the Military's repeater stations, we'll run into them sooner or later. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1, I suggest we retreat."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...No, we still have a chance now, given that the main body of the military forces is still on the area perimeter. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Once the armored units roll in, it'll be too late to do anything. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12, give me the route of advance for the Military's scouts. Our first priority is circling around them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, if it's just direction... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Military's axis of advance is roughly headed this way. If you want to avoid them, the most effective route would be to go through this area. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After we make it through this location, we'll be in the radar blind spot of the military units."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are the risks of taking that route?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Things will become more troublesome if Sangvis Ferri decides to get in our way. After all, it's tight terrain. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But after considering the wide detection radius of the Military, I cannot recommend taking any other route."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sangvis will always get in our way. It's the same wherever we go. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We'll head out, then. If you encounter any Sangvis units, destroy them quickly and move on."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Task Force DEFY clashes with Sangvis units along the path that avoids the military units."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are these Sangvis units standing guard with preprogrammed behavior patterns? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They crumble the moment we make contact with them. I'm not used to that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mastermind is handling the threat which the Military poses. Perhaps she's contracting her defense line."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She must know that these trash are meaningless in the face of the Military... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It feels more like...they're trying to draw us in..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Cease advance. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12, do you detect any abnormalities?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh? Still worried that it's a trap? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Nyet, at least I'm not picking up any signals..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"BOOM!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Boss","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Something crashes straight into AK-12's position, and a mighty explosion scatters the team."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-4","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"Intruder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You just happened to have entered my firing range. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Was this the T-Doll who's been searching for our signals all this while? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's not good to learn the names of the cast ahead of time, you know."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"nigh