 taking care of me, will you? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or could it be...you were hoping that Mastermind would send someone more important to deal with you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AN-94, from now on you will take AK-12's place."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But... AK-12, she..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get moving, AN-94!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm not dead yet, M4A1."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12 walks out of the smoke."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AN-94 won't be able to take it if you give her too much stress at times like these."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is that...your true appearance?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What a shame, I really liked that cape... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Judging by your ID signal...you must be Intruder, am I right? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I honestly didn't expect you to fire from outside of detection range."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-4","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"Intruder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I apologize, but it's true that my lethality at this range is nowhere near that of my superior's. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, that's fine. The preparations for the signal jamming are complete. Next, I shall personally bid you farewell."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Click. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Click! Click!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"雪地","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1, a large number of Sangvis signals have appeared in front and behind us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left",